# Context menu on a cell (Shift+F10 or right-click; here from the palette)
Output "tui-07-context-menu.gif"
Output "raw/tui-07-context-menu.mp4"
Source "../tapes/_setup.tape"
Sleep 800ms
Right 4
Sleep 400ms
# open: the control opens here (compose4.py syncs the 2x2 clips on it)
Ctrl+K
Type "context menu"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot "raw/tui-07-context-menu.png"
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
